      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can we double check with the standardization group if other texture format extension can be implicitly enabled by tier1? Like this one, and the float32 ones?",
      "revId": "fa29b9faf527326da5827b19228ca68b12ee72da",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "570615f5_fa740041",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/Format.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 5
