        "id": 4024649
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-06-30T01:50:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for your comments! Below are my findings:\n1.r8unormstorage: \n - Can be enabled via Tier 1.\n\n2.norm16textureformats/unorm16textureformats/snorm16textureformats:\n - Cannot be implicitly enabled by Tier 1. These features enable norm16 texture formats with resolving capability. A8-A10 series (Apple 2/3 family) Metal GPUs lacking resolving capability, which is a mandatory requirement for all Metal platforms in Tier1.\n\n3.float32filterable:\n - Cannot be implicitly enabled for two reasons:\n  a. Vulkan does not support filtering on float32 textures.\n  b. Metal support is limited to Apple 9 and Mac2 family GPUs.\n\n4.float32renderable:\n - Cannot be implicitly enabled by Tier 1 because Vulkan\u0027s lack of support for float32 blending.",
      "parentUuid": "c707f30b_8a7ca495",
      "revId": "fa29b9faf527326da5827b19228ca68b12ee72da",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1aa622b0_9375ab07",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/Format.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 499,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000002
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-07-01T07:05:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t know that for 2/3/4 the data shows that we cannot implicitly enable the extensions. The restrictions for the various extensions are different, but maybe the actual devices always support float32filterable (for example) when texture-tier1 is supported. (or we lose very few devices)\n\nCan you still open an issue about it on gpuweb? It would be very useful for developers if they could enable tier1 and not worry about the other optional features.\n\nIn all cases, after opening the issue, feel free to \"Ack\" these comment threads as they would otherwise be blocking this CL from landing (when it\u0027s just things for follow-ups)",
      "parentUuid": "570615f5_fa740041",
      "revId": "fa29b9faf527326da5827b19228ca68b12ee72da",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
