      "writtenOn": "2025-06-23T09:05:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can we open an issue and add a TODO to replace uses if U/Norm16TextureFormats with TextureFormatsTier1 as it should be just as widespread, and closer to the spec? Then we can remove that extension from Dawn. See https://source.chromium.org/search?q\u003dNorm16TextureFormats%20-f:%5Eout%20-f:third_party%2Fdawn\u0026sq\u003d",
      "revId": "fa29b9faf527326da5827b19228ca68b12ee72da",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
