      "writtenOn": "2025-06-30T01:50:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As mentioned before，norm16textureformats/unorm16textureformats/snorm16textureformats can not be implicitly enabled by Tier 1. These features enable norm16 texture formats with resolving capability. A8-A10 series (Apple 2/3 family) Metal GPUs lacking resolving capability, which is a mandatory requirement for all Metal platforms in Tier1.",
      "parentUuid": "cc1d6c90_07c5f130",
      "revId": "fa29b9faf527326da5827b19228ca68b12ee72da",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
