      "writtenOn": "2025-07-01T07:05:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is an experimental feature and only used for Graphite, so we could double check if it uses the resolve capability.\n\nAlso discussions culminating in https://github.com/gpuweb/gpuweb/issues/3838#issuecomment-1753309588 seem to say we don\u0027t support Apple3 GPUs for this extension.\n\nJiawei, do you remember why the resolve capability was not added in the extension for these formats?",
