      "message": "\u003e Jiawei, do you remember why the resolve capability was not added in the extension for these formats?\n\nIt is because Resolve capability is not supported on Apple2 and Apple3:\nhttps://developer.apple.com/metal/Metal-Feature-Set-Tables.pdf",
