      "writtenOn": "2025-06-23T09:05:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This file is starting to be pretty messy. We should find a way to make it nicer in the future. Maybe with something like that (but again, no need to do it now):\n\n```\n// Define all the formats as well as their base capability.\nDefineColorFormat(...) // Define instead of Add to show that support isn\u0027t necessarily added.\n// This wouldn\u0027t add capabilities and would have a UnsupportedReason::Undefined.\n\n// Add compat capabilities\nSupportFormat(rgba8unorm, Cap::...);\n...\n\n// Add core support\nif (core) {\n  SupportFormat(rgba8unorm, Cap::...);\n  AddCapability(..., Cap::...) // ASSERTs that the format is supported.\n} else {\n  ExplainWhyUnsupported(..., reason)\n}\n\n// texture-format-tier1\nif (texture-format-tier1) {\n  SupportFormat(..., Cap::...);\n  AddCapability(..., Cap::...) // ASSERTs that the format is supported.\n} else {\n  ExplainWhyUnsupported(..., reason)\n}\n\nfor each format {\n   ASSERT UnsupportedReason is not Undefined.\n}\n```",
      "revId": "fa29b9faf527326da5827b19228ca68b12ee72da",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
